OL,3,A'Everything is under mud': Nepal death
OL,4,Atoll rises to 389 amid fears of new
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers in Nepal and Tibet are racing
OL,8,Fto search for survivors after
OL,9,FWednesday's flash flood destroyed
OL,10,Fhomes, swamped roads and swept away
OL,11,Fbridges
OL,13,FMore than 900 people are missing and at
OL,14,Fleast 389 have died in Nepal
OL,16,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,17,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,18,Fdeluge - and there are risks of more
OL,19,Ffloods
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
