OL,3,A'Everything is under mud': Nepal death
OL,4,Atoll rises to 389 amid fears of new
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Nepalese Tourism Board says 667
OL,8,Fpeople are missing - including 178
OL,9,Ftourists from India, 65 Americans, and
OL,10,F33 from the UK
OL,12,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,13,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead, but
OL,14,Fit's not clear whether these figures
OL,15,Foverlap with Nepal's
OL,17,FA Nepalese man living in Aberdeen tells
OL,18,Fthe BBC how he lost three close family
OL,19,Fmembers in the flash floods
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
